tcp_connector D 03-29 17:35:23  3202 77441990 shared_fd.cpp:721] Connecting to socket: /tmp/cf_env_501/env-1/casimir_nci.sock
process_restarter D 03-29 17:35:23  3221 77442020 subprocess.cpp:522] Started (pid: 3243): /Users/jeffreyeffendy/.device/cache/emulators/<device>/bin/casimir
casimir D 03-29 17:35:23  3219 77442017 log_tee.cpp:142] [INFO  casimir] Listening for NCI connections on fd 48
casimir D 03-29 17:35:23  3219 77442017 log_tee.cpp:142] [INFO  casimir] Listening for RF connections on fd 49
casimir D 03-29 17:35:23  3219 77442017 log_tee.cpp:142] [INFO  casimir] Incoming NCI connection from (unnamed)
casimir D 03-29 17:35:23  3219 77442017 log_tee.cpp:142] [INFO  casimir] Accepted NCI connection from (unnamed) in slot 0
```

